Even though the VL53L0X is wired correctly, init() always returns false and the serial monitor shows "VL53L0X bulunamadi". What is missing from the code?

```
#include <VL53L0X.h>

VL53L0X sensor;

void setup() {
  Serial.begin(9600);
  sensor.setTimeout(500);
  if (!sensor.init()) {
    Serial.println("VL53L0X bulunamadi");
    while (true) {}
  }
  sensor.startContinuous();
}
